'''Zaan the Scalecaller''' is a renegade [[Online:Dragon Priest|Dragon Priest]] serving as the final boss of [[Online:Scalecaller Peak|Scalecaller Peak]]. She formerly served the dragon [[Online:Thurvokun|Thurvokun]], but after his departure she turned to worshiping [[Lore:Peryite|Peryite]] and has been granted his artifact, the [[Lore:Spellbreaker|Spellbreaker]]. Following her death at the hands of her irritated followers, she has now been awakened by a cult of Peryite, who plan to unleash a terrible plague upon Tamriel.

Zaan drops a guaranteed sample of [[ON:Infected Flesh|Infected Flesh]], and on Veteran difficulty drops a random head piece from [[ON:Zaan|her associated set]]. She drops more samples if defeated in Veteran Hard mode.
